% if i.example_1 and i.example_2:
<div id="ru_examples_${i.lemma_1_}" class="dpd content hidden">
% elif  i.example_1 and not i.example_2:
<div id="ru_example_${i.lemma_1_}" class="dpd content hidden">
% endif
    % if i.example_1:
    <p>
        ${i.example_1}
    </p>
    <p class="sutta">
        ${i.source_1} ${i.sutta_1}
    </p>
    % endif

    % if i.example_2:
    <p>
        ${i.example_2}
    </p>
    <p class="sutta">
        ${i.source_2} ${i.sutta_2}
    </p>
    % endif
    <p class='dpd-footer'>
        Пожалуйста, подскажите более подходящий <a class="dpd-link" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1iMD9sCSWFfJAFCFYuG9HRIyrr9KFRy0nAOVApM998wM/viewform?usp=pp_url&entry.438735500=${i.lemma_link}&entry.326955045=Примеры&entry.1433863141=GoldenDict+${today}" target="_blank">пример.</a>
    </p>
</div>
